  "prefLabel": "Ed 1307.04 Uses of Grant Funds for the Robotics Education Fund",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1307.04 Uses of Grant Funds for the Robotics Education Fund. Grant funds administered through the robotics education fund shall be limited to the purchase of robotics kits, stipends for coaches, and the payment of associated costs from participation in competitions.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1300) #12573, eff 7-14-18; ss by #12896, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 10-10-19, EXPIRES: 4-7-20",
